# Architecture — custom store, not Redux/Zustand

## Context

`app/src/store.ts` is a custom store, not a library. State changes only via
`store.dispatch(action)`.

## Rule

- New behavior: add `Action` in `types.ts` → handle in `reducer.ts` → add
  creator in `actions.ts`.
- Never add Redux/Zustand/MobX/Jotai or call `reducer()` directly from UI code.

## How to verify

1. `grep -rEi "redux|zustand|mobx|jotai" app/package.json app/src` → no matches.
2. Every new `Action` variant has a matching `case` in `reducer.ts` and a
   creator in `actions.ts`.
